# Words that sound alike, one group per line.
# Kazakh in Cyrillic script (42 letters). The Latin alphabet Kazakhstan is transitioning to is deliberately not used here; pkg/kb ships kbdkaz (Cyrillic) and CLDR kk is Cyrillic.
